# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS (or CODEOWNERS at the repo root) and replace the
# team slug. Branch protection must "require review from code owners"; without
# that, this file is only a notification.
#
# The approval record is security-owned: a developer may draft an entry with
# blank approvedBy/date, but only a security reviewer fills the sign-off. The
# reviewed diff is the audit evidence.

/approved.json                  @your-org/security
/.deps-policy.json              @your-org/security
/.github/workflows/deps.yml     @your-org/security
/policy/compromised.json        @your-org/security
